  "name": "Stuffed Dates for Ramadan",
  "recipe_type": "appetizer",
  "brief_description": "These stuffed dates filled with toasted almonds and served with creme fraiche are a delicious Ramadan snack. They are quick and easy to make and taste oh so good.",
  "cuisine": "North African",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Stuff each date with 1 whole toasted almond and arrange on a serving platter. Spoon a little bit of creme fraiche over each date and sprinkle with chopped almonds."
    }
